---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Starbucks gift-card race (Homakov, 2015): two sessions confirm the same transfer at once.
// Top: no lock, the balance check passes twice. Bottom: the pessimistic lock the write-up recommends.
// Plain inline SVG, site tokens only, polygon arrowheads (no duplicate ids).
---
<figure class="txsb">
  <div class="txsb-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 450" role="img" aria-label="Two panels. Top, no lock: two browser sessions send the confirm request for the same transfer; the transfer handler reads a balance of 5 in both requests, both checks pass, and two 5 dollar transfers leave a 5 dollar card, ending with cards holding 15 and 5. Bottom, with a pessimistic lock: the second request blocks on the row lock until the first finishes, then re-reads a balance of 0 and is refused.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="txsb-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Check, then act: why the second confirm slipped through</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Kiểm tra rồi mới làm: vì sao lệnh confirm thứ hai lọt qua</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="58" width="860" height="176" rx="6" class="txsb-panel is-bad" />
    <text x="36" y="84" class="txsb-sec is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Without a lock: both confirms see the same $5</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Không có khoá: cả hai lệnh confirm cùng thấy $5</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="102" width="170" height="44" rx="4" class="txsb-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={60} y={124} size={20} />
    <text x="80" y="119" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>session1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session1</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="80" y="137" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>POST step2?confirm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>POST step2?confirm</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="166" width="170" height="44" rx="4" class="txsb-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={60} y={188} size={20} />
    <text x="80" y="183" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>session2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session2</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="80" y="201" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>POST step2?confirm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>POST step2?confirm</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d="M212,124 L318,148" class="txsb-arrow" /><polygon points="326,150 317,152.5 319,143.5" class="txsb-head" />
    <path d="M212,188 L318,162" class="txsb-arrow" /><polygon points="326,160 319,166.5 317,157.5" class="txsb-head" />
    <rect x="328" y="112" width="250" height="98" rx="4" class="txsb-box is-bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={556} y={136} size={22} />
    <text x="342" y="136" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Transfer handler</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hàm xử lý chuyển tiền</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="342" y="158" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>read balance: 5 (request 1)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đọc số dư: 5 (request 1)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="342" y="178" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>read balance: 5 (request 2)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đọc số dư: 5 (request 2)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="342" y="200" class="txsb-note is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>both checks pass, both go on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cả hai lần kiểm tra đều qua</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d="M580,161 L668,161" class="txsb-arrow" /><polygon points="676,161 668,157 668,165" class="txsb-head" />
    <rect x="678" y="112" width="184" height="98" rx="4" class="txsb-box is-bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={838} y={136} size={22} />
    <text x="692" y="136" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>wallet1 row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng wallet1</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="692" y="158" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2 transfers of $5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 lệnh chuyển $5</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="692" y="180" class="txsb-note is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>cards end at $15 and $5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hai thẻ còn $15 và $5</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="252" width="860" height="176" rx="6" class="txsb-panel " />
    <text x="36" y="278" class="txsb-sec ">
      <tspan data-lang-en>With a pessimistic lock: the second confirm waits</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Có khoá bi quan: lệnh confirm thứ hai phải chờ</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="296" width="170" height="44" rx="4" class="txsb-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={60} y={318} size={20} />
    <text x="80" y="313" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>session1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session1</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="80" y="331" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>POST step2?confirm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>POST step2?confirm</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="360" width="170" height="44" rx="4" class="txsb-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={60} y={382} size={20} />
    <text x="80" y="377" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>session2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>session2</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="80" y="395" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>POST step2?confirm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>POST step2?confirm</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d="M212,318 L318,342" class="txsb-arrow" /><polygon points="326,344 317,346.5 319,337.5" class="txsb-head" />
    <path d="M212,382 L318,356" class="txsb-arrow" /><polygon points="326,354 319,360.5 317,351.5" class="txsb-head" />
    <rect x="328" y="306" width="250" height="98" rx="4" class="txsb-box is-ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={556} y={330} size={22} />
    <text x="342" y="330" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Transfer handler</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hàm xử lý chuyển tiền</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="342" y="352" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (request 1)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (request 1)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="342" y="372" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>request 2 blocks on the row lock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request 2 bị chặn ở khoá dòng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="342" y="394" class="txsb-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>then re-reads: balance is 0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>rồi đọc lại: số dư là 0</tspan>
    </text>
    <path d="M580,355 L668,355" class="txsb-arrow" /><polygon points="676,355 668,351 668,359" class="txsb-head" />
    <rect x="678" y="306" width="184" height="98" rx="4" class="txsb-box is-ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={838} y={330} size={22} />
    <text x="692" y="330" class="txsb-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>wallet1 row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng wallet1</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="692" y="352" class="txsb-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One transfer, one refusal</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 chuyển, 1 từ chối</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="692" y="374" class="txsb-note ">
      <tspan data-lang-en>no money created</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không sinh thêm tiền</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The Starbucks transfer flow checked the balance and moved the money in separate steps. Two sessions confirming at the same moment both passed the check (top). The write-up names a pessimistic lock, <code>FOR UPDATE</code>, as the only right fix (bottom). The bottom panel illustrates that fix; the write-up does not show Starbucks's internal code.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Luồng chuyển tiền của Starbucks kiểm tra số dư và chuyển tiền ở hai bước riêng. Hai phiên confirm cùng lúc đều qua được bước kiểm tra (trên). Bài viết gốc gọi khoá bi quan <code>FOR UPDATE</code> là cách sửa đúng duy nhất (dưới). Panel dưới minh hoạ cách sửa đó; bài gốc không cho thấy code nội bộ của Starbucks.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txsb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txsb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txsb svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txsb text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txsb .txsb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txsb .txsb-sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txsb .txsb-sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txsb .txsb-b { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txsb .txsb-m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txsb .txsb-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txsb .txsb-note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txsb-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txsb-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txsb-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txsb-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txsb-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txsb-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txsb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txsb figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
